WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.267
Everything on Appointments.

00:00:02.967 --> 00:00:12.633
Appointments. Sales visits, call-backs, collections and tasks for everyone. Each one sits on someone's day, so nothing is left without a date.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.233
New appointment. Opens the booking form. Let's have a look.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:28.400
Visit, phone call or task. Pick what it is, then the customer, what for, date, time and who. The tour "Book a visit, a phone call or a task" walks every field.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:31.567
Close it. Close it without booking.

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:37.733
Mine. Your own open appointments and tasks. The numbers on the tabs are counts.

00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:42.133
Search. Find one by subject, customer or place.

00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:48.300
By type. Estimate visit, Site visit, Call back, Collection, Service or Other.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.833
Grouped by day. Overdue first in red, then Today, Tomorrow and the days after, with how many on each.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:06.433
One appointment. The time (or Any time), what it's for, the customer, place and phone, a camera if the visit sent notes or photos, the type and who has it.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.933
Open it. Click the line to open it.

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:17.900
The details. When, with whom, the customer (click the name to open them), phone, address and the office notes.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:27.567
From the visit. Notes, measurements and photos the salesperson saved on the visit from the phone. Until then it says nothing came back yet.

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:39.867
Edit, visit done, mark done. Edit changes it. Visit done · estimate pending puts an estimate visit on Waiting on a quote. Mark done closes it. The tour presses none of them.

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.900
Close it. The X closes it.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:49.300
Edit. The pencil opens the form to change the day, time, person or details.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.567
Mark done. The tick marks it done. It moves to Done · 30 days.

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:58.567
Everyone. Every open appointment, whoever has it.

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:05.300
By person. Pick one person to see only theirs. It isn't on Mine, which is always yours.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:16.033
Waiting on a quote. Estimate visits marked Visit done · estimate pending: the quote is still to write. Mark the visit done once the estimate has gone out.

00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:24.133
Overdue. Everything past its date and still open, for everyone. Call, move it with the pencil, or mark it done.

00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:32.000
Done · 30 days. What was finished in the last 30 days, newest first. The arrow on a line reopens it.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:38.100
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
